"gossip": ["Heard the warden's been counting the grain twice a day.", "Between us? That mercenary is trouble."],
"argue": ["You watered it down again, didn't you?"],
"praise": ["Honest work, that."],
"joke": ["Two zombies walk into a tavern. Short joke, that."],
